hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16510","He said: Yunus narrated to us, Abu Awanah narrated to us, from Simak ibn Harb, from a man of the people of Madinah, that he prayed behind the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and heard him reciting in the Fajr prayer Qaf and the Glorious Quran, and Ya Sin and the Wise Quran."
